WEBVTT

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.400
Leave this to me!

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.660
Faster-Than-The-Eye-Can-See Punch!

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.610
Seal his blades, Seal Weapon!

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.420
Looks like it's birdlime.

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.040
Perfect for birds.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.670
For birds, hah!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.300
I saw that one coming!

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.030
Oh, no. You're not getting away.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.990
Breeze x 3 for a Tornado Combo!

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.850
Even with normal Cartado,
 it's all in how you use them.

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:41.300
Yusha, finish it!

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:42.100
Huh?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.940
Sei-chan, over there!

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:47.190
Don't play around!

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.690
It's fine!

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:57.510
V!

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.160
Hey, haven't we gotten stronger?

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.810
I've actually been thinking that, too.

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.210
Me, too!

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.210
We're strong!

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.860
Yahoo!

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.720
Congratulations, everyone 
in the Hero's party.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.300
As someone who's never failed to record

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.660
a single action you all have taken,

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.980
I feel just as happy myself.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.780
Endro!

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:01.530
Roll 11

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.280
So, now...

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:07.540
Give us quests for a Hero, please!

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.190
Anti-Chaos!

00:03:12.730 --> 00:03:15.300
What did you do that for, Sensei?!

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:17.700
Looks like you're back in your right minds.

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.730
Can't you fix it on your own when
you've been inflicted with Confusion?

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:23.430
We were in our right minds all along!

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:25.100
Also, Mao-sensei,

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.680
did you just cast magic
 without using any Cartado?

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.620
Gulp...

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.840
Never mind that.
 You wanted quests for a Hero?

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.190
What's the big idea?

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:35.540
Yes, we do!

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.960
Here, Mao-chan. Look at this!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:42.150
A receipt for an advanced 
quest to defeat a criffon?

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.700
I see. That means...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.700
Good luck with this.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.380
We completed it!

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:51.390
Exactly, Sensei!

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:52.830
If you need proof, here!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.400
From her chest?!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:02.970
Th-That's the legendary rare Cartado that's 
said to record everything, "Truth Recorder"!

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:06.460
Thank you for the explanation, Mathers-sama.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:12.320
Now, please watch this footage that I 
captured of Yusha-sama and the others!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:21.990
I can't believe you actually defeated a 
criffon and cleared an advanced quest.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.290
Princess, when did you...

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.990
I wanted to keep records of your actions.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:30.000
For the tale of our newest Hero.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:36.750
So I've been recording everything I've seen 
with my own eyes as your close friend.

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.010
Rona-chan!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.010
Princess!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.310
<i>I see.</i>

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:48.510
<i>Both Yulia Chardiet's group and the 
Hero-fanatic princess have grown, for sure.</i>

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.600
Thank you, Mao-chan!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.520
This is all due to everything you've taught us!

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.770
<i>I see. So this is what it's like
 to teach and guide others.</i>

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.030
So give us quests for a Hero!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:00.920
Can't.

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:03.770
Why not?!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:06.120
The Demon Lord hasn't even revived yet,

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.780
so why would there be
 any quests for a Hero?

00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:10.380
That makes sense.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.850
Well, can't have a Hero without a Demon Lord.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:18.230
You say that as if there's a secret conspiracy
 between some past Demon Lords and Heroes.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:22.800
Mao-sensei,

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:27.050
sometimes education requires 
both the carrot and the stick.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.640
I see. That's helpful to keep in mind.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:35.290
Also, if you're providing them, both carrot 
and stick would be "carrot" to me.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.380
I see.

00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.170
That's not helpful at all.

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.440
Hmm...

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:44.410
Since you've cleared an advanced quest,

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:46.840
maybe I'll give you a special reward.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.960
Reward?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:50.450
Yes. Anything in my power.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.450
I <i>really</i> want to defeat the Demon Lord.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:56.210
<i>Just how badly does she want to beat me up?</i>

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.380
She just told you, there <i>is</i> no Demon Lord.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:02.020
Is there anything else you want to do?

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.720
I know!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.550
It's been so long since we 
were in Mao-chan's house!

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:12.940
I never expected you to 
ask to come over again.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:16.440
Well, it's fun being 
invited to a friend's house!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:17.740
Right?

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.610
You're calling a teacher your friend?

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:23.180
I wish the Princess could have come, too.

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:27.980
Rona-san said she's busy 
organizing her footage of us.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:30.540
I'm eager to see what 
kind of book she writes.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.240
That's a long way off.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:35.650
Hey, don't make a fuss 
in this cramped space.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:37.220
Come on inside.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.000
It's a little messy, though.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.190
Pardon us—

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:46.130
<i>This is more than a little messy!</i>

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:52.450
I didn't think entering this room
 would mean cleaning again.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:57.130
I just assumed it was like this because 
of her Demon Lord Fever last time.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:59.460
We were wrong to blame it on that.

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:02.550
Sensei, I have a thought.

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:05.630
I believe everything that has 
form will someday fall apart.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:06.470
Yes.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:11.250
Likewise, any beautiful room 
will eventually become dirty.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.280
Mao-sensei...

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.280
Ellenoar Seiran...

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.320
Hey!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.230
Don't you two slobs start bonding!

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:23.790
<i>Oh, no! At this rate, my dignity as a 
teacher will plummet to the ground!</i>

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:28.090
Seira-chan, didn't you say you were going 
to clean your room the other day?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.190
I-I <i>am</i> cleaning it!

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:33.030
I should finish in a hundred years.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.180
Nice elf joke!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:39.490
Well, I guess I'll take care 
of the cooking again today.

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:40.500
Come on, ingredients!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.680
Mei-chan, I'll help, too!

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.560
Pound the meat to tenderize it!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:51.920
As you already know,
 Mei's cooking is the best.

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:52.760
Drool.

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:55.990
<i>Yes, my dignity's in serious danger,</i>

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.940
<i>just like this elf girl who's taking 
her long lifespan for granted</i>

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:01.060
<i>and claiming she'll get serious one day</i>

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.580
<i>when she's already abandoned
 all her femininity.</i>

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.650
<i>Which means...</i>

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.910
Today you're my guests!

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:11.340
Therefore, it's my job to cook for you all!

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.340
You'll cook?!

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.600
<i>Time to restore some
 of my dignity as a teacher!</i>

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.110
Final Dead End!

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:24.990
So, how do you like my cooking?

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.840
Incredible, Mao-chan...

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:28.550
But what's incredible...

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:30.340
...is that we were watching her do it,

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.490
but I can't tell what happened at all.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.490
Um, you didn't use any Cartado, did you?

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:39.220
Now, go on and eat up!

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.500
Cooking is all about creativity and 
improvisation, just like adventuring!

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.940
Time to eat!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.100
Is everyone alive?

00:08:52.100 --> 00:08:56.510
This flavor doesn't exist 
in the natural world.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:01.010
My mind's still clear,
 but I can only move my mouth.

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:07.520
It's as if it left our mouths alone 
solely to make us eat it all.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.820
What, are you all spending 
the night here, then?

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.150
I wonder if I have enough pillows.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.460
It's a waste to leave some behind.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:21.410
Come on, monster. There's still some left.

00:09:24.660 --> 00:09:26.390
Ch-Chibi-chan?!

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.550
How inhumane.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:31.170
Oh? Chibi-san's acting kind of...

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.590
What on earth is going on?!

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:46.060
Y-You'll make the landlord angry!

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:52.380
Y-You're...

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.540
<i>ENDRO!</i>

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:08.000
Oh, good morning, Mao-chan.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.420
Also, good morning, Meigo-chan.

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:14.550
Good morning, Yusha-sama.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:17.660
That certainly has settled 
into being her name.

00:10:17.660 --> 00:10:19.550
Well, she is a maid golem.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:21.300
So, "Meigo"!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.620
You just named her what she is.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:29.060
<i>Why are complications
 like this happening again?</i>

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.580
A maid popped out!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.260
Bad Chibi-chan!

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.510
Where did you even eat a maid?!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.850
That's quite a violent thing to say.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:39.780
Hold on.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.320
This girl isn't human.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:42.740
She's...

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:44.330
a golem.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:46.960
Even though she's so soft?

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.230
Stop!

00:10:48.590 --> 00:10:52.340
Still, I've never seen one that 
resembled a human so closely before.

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:55.140
<i>What is she doing here?!</i>

00:10:56.110 --> 00:10:57.960
<i>Before I got flung into the past,</i>

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.640
<i>she was an all-purpose golem that served me.</i>

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:03.490
<i>So what is she doing in this age?</i>

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:06.220
<i>And she came out of that monster's mouth?</i>

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:12.680
I have returned!

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.210
This time I shall destroy the world!

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:18.220
Wait, no! Not again!

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.060
Burp.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.030
<i>Well, more importantly...</i>

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.470
<i>If she wakes up,</i>

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:28.040
<i>they'll find out I'm the Demon Lord!</i>

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.290
Oh, looks like she's awake.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.050
Um...

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:48.850
Who am I?

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:54.190
Wow, I guess amnesia really 
is a thing that happens.

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.650
Oh, that reminds me.
 Sei-chan's weapon is a hammer, right?

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.720
I'm not doing that!

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:00.050
No?

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.480
Of course not!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:05.890
But I'm sure she'll be fine,
 since she's living with Mao-chan for a while!

00:12:05.890 --> 00:12:08.870
You're even bringing her to school with you.

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.080
Well, I can't just leave her alone.

00:12:11.400 --> 00:12:14.130
<i>I'm even more anxious when she's not nearby.</i>

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.180
She's not bullying you, is she?

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:18.880
No, she is treating me very well.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.130
No, I meant in terms of your sense of taste.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.940
Oh, shut up!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:26.390
Besides, preparing our food 
has already become her job!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:27.320
Oh?

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:31.140
So that means she won you over 
through your stomach, then?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.520
What a weird way to put it...

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.480
You homewrecker!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.360
Would you go prepare to 
teach your classes already?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:48.420
Today has been exhausting.

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.750
You've done a good job, Mao-sama.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:56.630
<i>Most of it is from fretting about what 
to do when your memories come back!</i>

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:01.880
I guess I'll have a drink with my 
coworker before I go home.

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.050
I see.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.740
In that case, I'll head home by myself.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:17.150
<i>It's almost as if she's...</i>

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:21.180
Actually, I think I'll lounge 
around at home instead.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:25.360
Understood, Mao-sama.

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:26.800
Hmph.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.400
How many times must I tell you?

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:34.220
But...

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:38.140
I can't eat in peace with you standing there.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.690
This is an order!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.500
I understand.

00:13:41.970 --> 00:13:43.760
Pardon me, then.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.260
Time to eat.

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:50.580
Oh?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.140
This soup is delicious.

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:53.420
Yes.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:57.180
I got the fishmonger to share 
some of his secret broth.

00:13:57.180 --> 00:14:00.760
Apparently, the product is labeled
 "Mackerelman Leftovers."

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:05.040
I think I'm better off not pursuing
 the details any further.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.470
I see.

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:10.290
Oh, have some of this 
salt-fried tottori, as well.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.400
This looks good, too.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.730
<i>You know...</i>

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:21.320
I'll allow it. Join me for dinner.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:24.340
A servant is never permitted to do that.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.020
<i>This isn't so bad.</i>

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:34.370
<i>Wait, I've been keeping this girl beside 
me so I can keep an eye on her!</i>

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.030
Ahem!

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:57.500
I have a report!

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.590
I've reached a cut-off point in 
the organization of my records.

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.250
Good job.

00:15:02.510 --> 00:15:05.380
Why are you all in my home?

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:10.060
Because I wanted to try being invited 
over to a friend's home, as well.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.780
I told you, I'm not your friend!
I'm your teacher!

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:16.390
And besides, my home is super tiny!

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.180
Meigo-sama.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.060
Yes?

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.400
Please rest assured.

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.330
In anticipation of something like this,

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:28.150
I always keep with me a legendary 
rare that restores memories!

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:30.840
Wait! It restores them, 
no matter what happened?!

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:32.950
That's incredible, Rona-chan!

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.160
This is good news.
 You'll get your memories back!

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:37.910
Do you... really think so?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.380
<i>It's not good. It's not good!</i>

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:42.790
<i>I'm in trouble if you use that thing 
and restore her lost memories!</i>

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.560
Hold on! Hold on!

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.740
You can't force her. You should be more carefu—

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:52.140
Sealed door of memories,
 open before this light of blessing!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.440
How did it go, Meigo-sama?

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.440
It didn't work.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.570
I-It didn't?

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.610
Oh, well! That happens sometimes.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.300
Hmm, maybe I was out of magic power?

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.070
No need to be upset.s

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.070
Mathers-sama?

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.760
I just remembered!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.450
Wait, <i>they</i> did?!

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:23.210
We met at the adventurer school,
 formed a party...

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:26.600
And during class,
 Yusha drew the Hero's Sword.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:32.720
And then we set off on a journey as the 
Hero's party, to defeat the Demon Lord.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.100
We went on lots and lots of adventures

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:37.510
and finally arrived at the 
Demon Lord's castle.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.090
Then we fought the Demon Lord...

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:46.910
And...

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:50.440
After we were thrown back into the past,

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.820
we met each other once again, right?

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:57.580
Mei-chan, Fai-chan, Seira-chan.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.080
Yusha-san.

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:00.560
Yu-chan.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:01.970
Yusha.

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.960
You did this!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.500
This was your fault for flubbing 
the chant to that forbidden spell!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.840
I'm so sorry!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:15.470
In other words, you all have practically 
defeated the Demon Lord already, then!

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:16.490
Huh?

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:19.020
Yeah, that was easy!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:21.660
That's what happens when we all get serious.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.230
<i>"Serious" how?!</i>

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:25.840
Well, then, what about Meigo-sama here?

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.100
Yeah.

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:29.230
As I recall,

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.670
she was the final enemy
 protecting the Demon Lord's room,

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:34.000
and she was stronger than his Four Generals.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:40.490
I couldn't tell you why she just popped 
out of Chibi-chan's mouth, though.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:43.110
If Meigo-sama is the Demon Lord's attendant,

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.620
wouldn't she know where 
the Demon Lord is right now?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.330
<i>Gulp!</i>

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:49.210
I don't know... You think she'll tell us?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:52.370
You think the Demon Lord's 
attendant is going to confess?

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:57.080
There's nothing we can do about it anyway,
 since her memories haven't returned.

00:17:57.080 --> 00:18:02.270
Then why don't we just use her as a hostage
 to draw the Demon Lord out... maybe?

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:04.970
Elves are scary.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.270
I was kidding! I was just kidding!

00:18:07.550 --> 00:18:11.520
Well, for now, let's keep her
 in the Lapanestra Kingdom!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:15.390
We certainly can't allow something 
related to the Demon Lord to run free.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:18.050
Right! That's a good idea.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:19.250
I see.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.530
You're right.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:25.520
<i>If she didn't regain her 
memories with that spell,</i>

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:29.020
<i>there's no more chance of 
her recalling my true identity.</i>

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:32.360
<i>This means my peaceful life 
will be secure once more.</i>

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:34.680
<i>Don't hate me for this.</i>

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:37.070
<i>Besides, this is the Princess 
we're talking about.</i>

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:39.050
<i>She won't do anything to hurt you.</i>

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:45.960
<i>Is she afraid?</i>

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:48.060
<i>Her, a golem without any emotions?</i>

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:53.880
You needn't worry yourself.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:57.950
<i>Have your memories returned?!</i>

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:01.070
In that case, you may take me in.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:04.200
We won't mistreat you. Don't worry.

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:06.460
<i>Calm down, now.</i>

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:10.150
<i>She may look human, but she's just a golem.</i>

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:15.400
I am a golem created to serve the Demon Lord.

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:17.900
<i>She's not alive.</i>

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:20.410
<i>She's only capable of doing as she's ordered.</i>

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:22.750
<i>She's just...</i>

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:25.760
But if the Demon Lord's attendant is here,

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.980
then the Demon Lord must 
be out there somewhere.

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:29.740
So we have to defeat him!

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:33.360
Because I'm the Hero!

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.110
Yusha...

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.450
<i>That's right.</i>

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:44.290
<i>In the same way that she 
has her pride as the Hero...</i>

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.120
<i>I, too...</i>

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:48.750
I won't let you!

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:50.370
Mao-chan?

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.430
<i>I have my own pride, too.</i>

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:55.750
<i>What Demon Lord would abandon 
their loyal servants?!</i>

00:19:58.280 --> 00:19:59.140
Th-This is...

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:00.820
What incredible magic power.

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:02.260
Mao-chan-sensei?

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:12.770
Demon Lord...

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:16.060
What's the matter, Yulia Chardiet?

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.780
No... Legendary Hero!

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:23.530
Have you not been longing 
to defeat the Demon Lord?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.160
Is that you, Mao-chan?

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.460
I am the Demon Lord.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:33.420
The Demon Lord who shall 
rule over Naral Island!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:39.190
Rona-chan!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:47.260
If you want to save the princess, 
then come to my castle, Hero!

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:53.190
I'll make you taste true despair once more!

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:00.570
No way...

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.620
I can't believe Mao-chan-sensei 
is the Demon Lord.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.160
But that form and that magic power

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.140
were definitely those of the 
Demon Lord in our memories.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.360
Rona-chan...

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.560
Meigo-chan...

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:14.720
Mao-chan...

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:57.630
Sensei...

00:22:59.440 --> 00:23:01.630
No, Demon Lord.

00:23:02.320 --> 00:23:04.210
Why are you doing this?

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:07.910
You want to know?

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.780
I got caught up in the moment,

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:27.550
and I did it without thinking.

00:23:27.940 --> 00:23:29.340
What?

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.060
After the End Roll...

00:23:36.120 --> 00:23:38.020
"After the End Roll..."
